WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.419
Compare rural and urban lifestyles

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:09.400
Population: the number of people living in an area. Rural settlement: a community

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:12.200
with fewer buildings and many agricultural activities.

00:00:13.033 --> 00:00:17.856
Urban settlement: a place with more buildings and a larger concentration of people.

00:00:17.856 --> 00:00:22.678
Migration: movement from one place to live in another. Public service: a facility

00:00:22.678 --> 00:00:26.388
such as a school or clinic that meets community needs.

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:31.296
Make a two-column chart of services needed in rural and urban communities.
